  "prompt": "Which accounts make the top 3 of each segment by MRR in euros on 2025-12-31? An account's MRR on 2025-12-31 is the sum of its subscription events' mrr_delta_local with event_date on or before 2025-12-31, in the subscription's currency; convert it to euros at the fx_rates rate of 2025-12-31 for that currency. Accounts of a segment that tie on MRR share a place, and the place after a tie skips the places the tied accounts use, so a tie for third keeps a fourth account. Return four columns, in this order: segment, account_id, mrr_eur (the account's MRR in euros on 2025-12-31) and mrr_place, its place in its segment from 1 for the highest. Return one row for each account with a place of 3 or better. Any row order is fine.",
